MODIFICATIONS
-------------
Pursuant to section 4(b) of the Apache License, Version 2.0, the following
files from the upstream project have been changed:

  models/cudagraph/depth_decoder_graph.py
      Added an explicit `compile_layers` switch so that CUDA graph capture and
      torch.compile can be selected independently.

  models/fast_streaming.py
      Reads BREEZE_DEPTH_GRAPH_NO_COMPILE to select capture-only mode.

  README.md
      Added a section with measurements taken on a single 8 GB GPU.

  .gitignore
      Added local runtime artifacts (logs, checkpoints, wheel cache).

The following components are new and were not part of the upstream project:

  panel.py, synth.py, start_api.sh, download_weights.sh, start_fast.bat
  web/            the browser front end served by panel.py
  tts_pipeline/   text normalization, pronunciation dictionary, reference
                  audio preparation, speaker similarity
  tests/          test suite (upstream tests are unmodified)

